<title>INDIA: India relaxes gold import rule for non-residents.</title>
<headline>India relaxes gold import rule for non-residents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India eased gold import restrictions on Tuesday by allowing non-resident Indians to import 10 kg of gold every six months compared to five kg previously, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said.</p>
</text>
